# ELGI Enterprise API

The backend API for the ELGI Educational Ecosystem.

## Project Overview

ELGI Enterprise API provides the foundation for organisation management, user authentication, stakeholder management and audit logging.

## Technology Stack

- Python
- FastAPI
- SQLAlchemy
- Pydantic
- SQLite / PostgreSQL
- JWT Authentication
- Argon2 Password Hashing

## Core Features

- User registration and login
- Organisation management
- Secure authentication
- Stakeholder management
- Organisation-level data isolation
- Audit logging
- REST API endpoints

## Development Status

Development and testing are ongoing.

## Project

E-learning Group Institute Ghana (ELGI).
